    <briefdescription>
<para>JSON document evaluator using field-level overlap. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>RS = <computeroutput>(total_fields − changed_fields) / total_fields</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>&quot;Changed&quot; includes added, removed, and value-modified top-level keys. If the input is not valid JSON, it falls back to <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1delegate__eval_1_1_plain_text_evaluator" kindref="compound">PlainTextEvaluator</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Only top-level keys are compared; nested object diffing is left to future versions. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
